{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
QUICK FIXES (templates/page.quick-fixes.json, /pages/quick-fixes)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
"What can you see on your player?" A photo of the current player (no switch on the back; a drawing if no photo is set)
with one row of chips for the play button light and one for the battery light. Picking a chip lights the player (play button glow, battery
strip at the bottom right; on the drawing only, the buttons to press outlined) and shows what it means and how to fix it beside it on
desktop; on phones a "<title>: what to do ↓" link under the player jumps to the answer.
Then: every light at a glance, the "colour that isn't listed" note (workshop test mode: how to get out only, never how
to get in), and the 30-second reset. "Player look different?" swaps the whole section to short fixes for our first
players (on/off switch on the back). Never call the players V1/V2 on the site.

Blocks:
- "Light" (one per state; group play or battery). The answer for each light is rendered in the page, so it works
  without JavaScript (all answers show, the chips jump to them) and can be linked: /pages/quick-fixes#light-<id>
  (e.g. #light-pink for travel mode; use these links in customer service replies and Saga).
- "First players fix": short fixes shown under "Player look different?". Link: /pages/quick-fixes#first-players

Animations (flashing, pulsing): the player always shows the chosen light's movement; chips and tiles only while the
pointer is over them. Never with prefers-reduced-motion. Light colours and the light reference: LPS project doc claude/player-lights-reference.md.
Styles: voxblock.css "HELP PAGES". Script: voxblock.js "QUICK FIXES" (PostHog quick_fix_view { state, source },
quick_fix_model { model }).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign default_id = section.settings.default_state | handleize
  assign first_id = ''
  assign default_found = false
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'state'
      assign bid = block.settings.state_id | handleize
      if first_id == ''
        assign first_id = bid
      endif
      if bid == default_id
        assign default_found = true
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  unless default_found
    assign default_id = first_id
  endunless
-%}

<section class="qf" id="{{ section.settings.anchor | default: 'what-you-can-see' | escape }}" data-qf data-model="current" data-default="{{ default_id }}" {{ section.shopify_attributes }}>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- Current players ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="qf-current">
    <div class="qf-top">
      <div class="container qf-layout">
        <div class="qf-col qf-col--player">
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.type == 'state' -%}
              {%- assign bid = block.settings.state_id | handleize -%}
              {%- if bid == default_id -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign s = block.settings
                  if s.group == 'battery'
                    assign p_led = s.other_led
                    assign p_anim = 'none'
                    assign b_led = s.led
                    assign b_anim = s.animation
                  else
                    assign p_led = s.led
                    assign p_anim = s.animation
                    assign b_led = 'off'
                    assign b_anim = 'none'
                  endif
                  assign press = ''
                  if s.press_play
                    assign press = press | append: ' play'
                  endif
                  if s.press_left
                    assign press = press | append: ' left'
                  endif
                  if s.press_right
                    assign press = press | append: ' right'
                  endif
                  if s.press_minus
                    assign press = press | append: ' minus'
                  endif
                  if s.press_plus
                    assign press = press | append: ' plus'
                  endif
                  assign press = press | strip
                  assign d_title = s.title
                  assign d_caption = s.caption
                  assign d_eyebrow = s.eyebrow
                  assign d_book = s.book_on
                  assign d_cable = s.cable
                -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}

          {%- capture player_alt -%}Voxblock player, {{ d_eyebrow | downcase }}{% if press != blank and section.settings.player_image == blank %}, with the buttons to press outlined{% endif %}{%- endcapture -%}
          <div class="qf-player qf-host{% if section.settings.player_image != blank %} qf-player--photo{% endif %}" role="img" aria-label="{{ player_alt | escape }}" data-qf-player
            data-play-led="{{ p_led }}" data-play-anim="{{ p_anim }}" data-strip-led="{{ b_led }}" data-strip-anim="{{ b_anim }}"
            data-press="{{ press }}" data-book="{{ d_book }}" data-cable="{{ d_cable }}"
            style="--qf-play: var(--led-{{ p_led | replace: '_', '-' }}); --qf-strip: var(--led-{{ b_led | replace: '_', '-' }});">
            {%- if section.settings.player_image != blank -%}
              {%- comment -%} Photo of the player: the lights and outlines sit over it, placed by % of the photo (voxblock.css) {%- endcomment -%}
              {{ section.settings.player_image | image_url: width: 642 | image_tag: class: 'qf-player__photo', widths: '320, 480, 642', sizes: '(min-width: 1000px) 280px, 240px', alt: '', loading: 'eager' }}
              <span class="qf-player__book" aria-hidden="true">
                {%- if section.settings.book_image != blank -%}
                  {{ section.settings.book_image | image_url: width: 450 | image_tag: widths: '200, 300, 450', sizes: '(min-width: 1000px) 164px, 140px', alt: '', loading: 'eager' }}
                {%- else -%}
                  {{ section.settings.book_label | escape }}
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
              <span class="qf-key qf-key--left" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="qf-key qf-key--minus" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="qf-key qf-key--play" aria-hidden="true"><span class="qf-player__glow"></span></span>
              <span class="qf-key qf-key--plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="qf-key qf-key--right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="qf-player__strip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <svg class="qf-player__cable" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 40 100" width="40" height="100">
                <defs><linearGradient id="qf-cable-fade-{{ section.id }}" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#fff"/><stop offset=".72" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient><mask id="qf-cable-mask-{{ section.id }}"><rect width="40" height="100" fill="url(#qf-cable-fade-{{ section.id }})"/></mask></defs>
                <g mask="url(#qf-cable-mask-{{ section.id }})">
                  <path d="M20 40c0 22 12 30 12 60" fill="none" stroke="#b9c3c4" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                  <path d="M20 40c0 22 12 30 12 60" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                </g>
                <rect x="15" y="29" width="10" height="12" rx="3" fill="#fff" stroke="#b9c3c4" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <rect x="10" y="1" width="20" height="30" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#b9c3c4" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              </svg>
            {%- else -%}
            <span class="qf-player__grill" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
            <span class="qf-player__dock" aria-hidden="true"><span class="qf-player__book">{{ section.settings.book_label | escape }}</span></span>
            <span class="qf-player__keys" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="qf-key qf-key--left"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M7.5 2.5 4 6l3.5 3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
              <span class="qf-key qf-key--minus"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M3 7h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
              <span class="qf-key qf-key--play"><span class="qf-player__glow"></span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path d="M6 4l8 5-8 5z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
              <span class="qf-key qf-key--plus"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M3 7h8M7 3v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
              <span class="qf-key qf-key--right"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M4.5 2.5 8 6 4.5 9.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
            </span>
            <span class="qf-player__strip-row" aria-hidden="true"><span class="qf-player__strip"></span></span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>

          <p class="qf-caption" data-qf-caption>{{ d_caption | escape }}</p>
          <a class="qf-jump" href="#qf-answer" data-qf-jump><span><span data-qf-jump-title>{{ d_title | escape }}</span>: {{ section.settings.jump_text | escape }}</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <p class="qf-footnote">{{ section.settings.footnote_text | escape }} <a href="#first-players" data-qf-model="earlier">{{ section.settings.footnote_link | escape }}</a>.</p>

          {%- assign groups = 'play,battery' | split: ',' -%}
          {%- for group in groups -%}
            {%- if group == 'play' -%}{%- assign row_title = section.settings.play_row_title -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign row_title = section.settings.battery_row_title -%}{%- endif -%}
            <div class="qf-row">
              <h2 class="qf-row__title" id="qf-row-{{ group }}-{{ section.id }}">{{ row_title | escape }}</h2>
              <div class="qf-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="qf-row-{{ group }}-{{ section.id }}">
                {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
                  {%- if block.type == 'state' and block.settings.group == group -%}
                    {%- assign bid = block.settings.state_id | handleize -%}
                    <a class="qf-chip qf-host" href="#light-{{ bid }}" data-qf-pick="{{ bid }}" data-qf-source="chip"{% if bid == default_id %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>
                      {%- render 'player-light-icon', group: group, led: block.settings.led, animation: block.settings.animation -%}
                      <span>{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</span>
                    </a>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        <div class="qf-col qf-col--answer" id="qf-answer">
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.type == 'state' -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign s = block.settings
                assign bid = s.state_id | handleize
                if s.group == 'battery'
                  assign p_led = s.other_led
                  assign p_anim = 'none'
                  assign b_led = s.led
                  assign b_anim = s.animation
                else
                  assign p_led = s.led
                  assign p_anim = s.animation
                  assign b_led = 'off'
                  assign b_anim = 'none'
                endif
                assign press = ''
                if s.press_play
                  assign press = press | append: ' play'
                endif
                if s.press_left
                  assign press = press | append: ' left'
                endif
                if s.press_right
                  assign press = press | append: ' right'
                endif
                if s.press_minus
                  assign press = press | append: ' minus'
                endif
                if s.press_plus
                  assign press = press | append: ' plus'
                endif
                assign press = press | strip
                assign steps = s.steps | newline_to_br | split: '<br />'
              -%}
              <article class="qf-answer{% if bid == default_id %} is-active{% endif %}" id="light-{{ bid }}" data-qf-state="{{ bid }}"
                data-play-led="{{ p_led }}" data-play-anim="{{ p_anim }}" data-strip-led="{{ b_led }}" data-strip-anim="{{ b_anim }}"
                data-press="{{ press }}" data-book="{{ s.book_on }}" data-cable="{{ s.cable }}" data-caption="{{ s.caption | escape }}" data-eyebrow="{{ s.eyebrow | escape }}"
                data-title="{{ s.title | escape }}"
                aria-labelledby="light-{{ bid }}-title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <p class="qf-answer__eyebrow qf-host">
                  {%- render 'player-light-icon', group: s.group, led: s.led, animation: s.animation -%}
                  <span>{{ s.eyebrow | escape }}</span>
                </p>
                <h2 class="h3 qf-answer__title" id="light-{{ bid }}-title">{{ s.title | escape }}</h2>
                {%- if s.meaning != blank -%}<p class="qf-answer__meaning">{{ s.meaning | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if s.steps != blank -%}
                  <div class="qf-answer__fix">
                    {%- if s.fix_heading != blank -%}<h3 class="h5 qf-answer__fix-title">{{ s.fix_heading | escape }}</h3>{%- endif -%}
                    <ol class="help-steps">
                      {%- for step in steps -%}
                        {%- assign step_text = step | strip -%}
                        {%- if step_text != blank -%}<li>{{ step_text | escape }}</li>{%- endif -%}
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </ol>
                  </div>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if s.done != blank -%}
                  <p class="qf-answer__done">
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path d="M3.5 9.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                    <span>{{ s.done | escape }}</span>
                  </p>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if s.more_label != blank and s.more_link != blank -%}
                  <a class="qf-answer__more" href="{{ s.more_link }}" data-help-track="qf_more_{{ bid }}">{{ s.more_label | escape }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                {%- endif -%}
              </article>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container qf-more">
      {%- if section.settings.glance_heading != blank -%}
        <div class="qf-glance">
          <h2 class="h3">{{ section.settings.glance_heading | escape }}</h2>
          <div class="qf-glance__grid">
            {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
              {%- if block.type == 'state' -%}
                {%- assign bid = block.settings.state_id | handleize -%}
                <a class="qf-tile qf-host" href="#light-{{ bid }}" data-qf-pick="{{ bid }}" data-qf-source="tile"{% if bid == default_id %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>
                  <span class="qf-tile__eyebrow">
                    {%- render 'player-light-icon', group: block.settings.group, led: block.settings.led, animation: block.settings.animation -%}
                    <span>{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="qf-tile__title">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</span>
                  <span class="qf-tile__text">{{ block.settings.short | escape }}</span>
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.test_heading != blank -%}
        <div class="qf-note" id="other-colours">
          <h2 class="h5">{{ section.settings.test_heading | escape }}</h2>
          <p>{{ section.settings.test_text | escape }}</p>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.restart_heading != blank -%}
        <div class="qf-restart" id="{{ section.settings.restart_anchor | default: 'restart' | escape }}">
          <h2 class="h3">{{ section.settings.restart_heading | escape }}</h2>
          {%- if section.settings.restart_intro != blank -%}<div class="qf-restart__intro">{{ section.settings.restart_intro }}</div>{%- endif -%}
          <div class="qf-restart__card">
            <div class="qf-timeline" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="qf-timeline__a">{{ section.settings.timeline_1 | escape }}</span>
              <span class="qf-timeline__b">{{ section.settings.timeline_2 | escape }}</span>
              <span class="qf-timeline__c">{{ section.settings.timeline_3 | escape }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="help-steps help-steps--grid">{{ section.settings.restart_steps }}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- First players (on/off switch on the back) ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="qf-earlier" id="first-players">
    <div class="container qf-earlier__inner">
      <p class="qf-earlier__back"><a href="#what-you-can-see" data-qf-model="current"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> {{ section.settings.back_text | escape }}</a></p>
      <div class="qf-earlier__head">
        <h2 class="h2">{{ section.settings.earlier_heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- if section.settings.earlier_intro != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.earlier_intro | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="qf-earlier__grid">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.type == 'earlier_fix' -%}
            {%- assign steps = block.settings.steps | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
            <div class="qf-earlier__card" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <h3 class="h5">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</h3>
              {%- if block.settings.steps != blank -%}
                <ol>
                  {%- for step in steps -%}
                    {%- assign step_text = step | strip -%}
                    {%- if step_text != blank -%}<li>{{ step_text | escape }}</li>{%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </ol>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}<p>{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Quick fixes",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "shopify-section--quick-fixes",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "anchor", "label": "Anchor (no #)", "default": "what-you-can-see" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "default_state", "label": "Light shown first (its ID)", "default": "pink", "info": "Travel mode (pink) is the light people most often email about." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Player" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "player_image", "label": "Player photo", "info": "Front view, cut out, cropped to the player. The lights are placed over it for quick-fixes-player-front.webp; another photo needs the positions in voxblock.css (QUICK FIXES) changed. Blank shows a drawing." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "book_image", "label": "Book on the player", "info": "Flat front cover, cut out." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "book_label", "label": "Book label on the drawing", "default": "Your book" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "play_row_title", "label": "Play button row", "default": "Play button" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "battery_row_title", "label": "Battery light row", "default": "Battery light" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "jump_text", "label": "Phone link to the answer", "default": "what to do", "info": "Shown on phones as '<light title>: what to do ↓'" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "footnote_text", "label": "Footnote", "default": "Player look different? If yours has an on/off switch on the back," },
    { "type": "text", "id": "footnote_link", "label": "Footnote link", "default": "see the fixes for our first players" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "All the lights" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "glance_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "All the lights at a glance", "info": "Blank hides the grid." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colour that isn't listed" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "test_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Seeing a colour that isn't listed?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "test_text", "label": "Text", "info": "How to get out of the workshop test mode only. Don't say how to get into it.", "default": "If the play button glows white, or changes colour and buzzes each time you press a button, the player is in a checking mode we use in our workshop. Nothing is wrong and nothing is harmed. Hold the play button until the player switches off (about 5 seconds), then switch it on again as normal." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Reset" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "restart_anchor", "label": "Anchor (no #)", "default": "reset" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "restart_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Still stuck? Reset the player" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "restart_intro", "label": "Intro", "default": "<p>Only if nothing else has worked. A reset clears the places saved on the player, so every book starts again from the beginning. Your books and their stories aren't affected.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "timeline_1", "label": "Timeline: first part", "default": "0–3 s" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "timeline_2", "label": "Timeline: middle", "default": "Light goes off. Keep holding…" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "timeline_3", "label": "Timeline: end", "default": "30 s: let go" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "restart_steps", "label": "Steps", "info": "Use a numbered list.", "default": "<ol><li>Press and hold the play button.</li><li>After a few seconds the light goes off. <strong>Don't let go.</strong> Letting go here only switches it off.</li><li>Keep holding for 30 seconds in total, then let go.</li><li>Wait 10 seconds before switching it back on, so it starts first time.</li><li>Press play to switch it on. The button glows blue when it's ready.</li></ol>" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "First players" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "back_text", "label": "Back link", "default": "Back to the player without a switch" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "earlier_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Our first players" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "earlier_intro", "label": "Intro", "default": "These players have an on/off switch on the back. Most problems come down to the switch, the charge or a dusty connector." }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "state",
      "name": "Light",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "state_id", "label": "ID", "info": "Short, lower case, used in links: /pages/quick-fixes#light-<ID>", "default": "blue" },
        { "type": "select", "id": "group", "label": "Light", "default": "play", "options": [
          { "value": "play", "label": "Play button" },
          { "value": "battery", "label": "Battery light" }
        ] },
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Chip label", "default": "Blue" },
        { "type": "select", "id": "led", "label": "Colour", "default": "blue", "options": [
          { "value": "off", "label": "Off" },
          { "value": "blue", "label": "Blue" },
          { "value": "blue_dim", "label": "Dim blue" },
          { "value": "green", "label": "Green" },
          { "value": "orange", "label": "Orange" },
          { "value": "pink", "label": "Pink" },
          { "value": "yellow_green", "label": "Yellow-green" },
          { "value": "red", "label": "Red" }
        ] },
        { "type": "select", "id": "animation", "label": "Movement", "default": "none", "info": "Shown only while the pointer is over it.", "options": [
          { "value": "none", "label": "Steady" },
          { "value": "blink", "label": "Flashing (1 s)" },
          { "value": "fast", "label": "Fast flashing" },
          { "value": "pulse", "label": "Slow pulse" },
          { "value": "flash", "label": "Quick flash" },
          { "value": "fade", "label": "Shows, then fades to dark" }
        ] },
        { "type": "select", "id": "other_led", "label": "Play button colour in the drawing", "info": "Battery lights only.", "default": "off", "options": [
          { "value": "off", "label": "Off" },
          { "value": "blue", "label": "Blue" },
          { "value": "green", "label": "Green" }
        ] },
        { "type": "checkbox", "id": "book_on", "label": "Book on the player in the drawing", "default": true },
        { "type": "checkbox", "id": "cable", "label": "Charging cable plugged in", "info": "Player photo only. For lights that show only while it's plugged in.", "default": false },
        { "type": "header", "content": "Buttons to outline" },
        { "type": "checkbox", "id": "press_play", "label": "Play", "default": false },
        { "type": "checkbox", "id": "press_left", "label": "Left arrow", "default": false },
